  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/lava_monsters_banner_2026.webp\" alt=\"undefined\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/thBV2Mq\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/223938153260515328.svg?color=7289DA&label=discord&logo=discord&logoColor=FFFFFF&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Modding Legacy Discord Server\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fweblate.moddinglegacy.com%252fprojects%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/translate-weblate-2ECCAA?style=for-the-badge&logo=weblate&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Contribute to Lava Monsters by helping break the language barrier by translating on Weblate!\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fModdingLegacy\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ko--fi-support-FF5E5B?style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"If you like what we do, please consider supporting us on Ko-fi! Thank you!\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/BUILT_WITH-NEOFORGE-d7742f?style=for-the-badge&logo=neoforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Built with NeoForge\"> </a> <br><br><a href=\"https://twitter.com/ModdingLegacy\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/ModdingLegacy?style=social\" alt=\"Follow us! ModdingLegacy Twitter\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252fmoddinglegacy.com\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/moddinglegacy.com-0285FF?logo=bluesky&logoColor=00&style=social\" alt=\"Follow us! moddinglegacy.com Bluesky\"> </a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/channel/UCUhDvKdbaKHrKvV5kcKqqiQ\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCUhDvKdbaKHrKvV5kcKqqiQ?sub_confirmation=1&style=social&label=@ModdingLegacy\" alt=\"Subscribe to us on YouTube!\"> </a></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:1em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-style:italic;text-align:center;font-weight:600\">添加了在岩浆中生成的怪物。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"color:#ff9c00;font-family:Palatino Linotype, sans-serif;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">🔥 简介</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:1em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">如果你曾因为挖掘到岩浆层后敌对生物不再刷新而感到无聊，那么这个模组就是为你准备的！这是一个小型模组，向游戏中添加了新的敌对怪物——岩浆怪物。它们会在岩浆中生成，并向你喷射火球。岩浆怪物的生成条件可以在方便的属性文件中进行调整！</p>\n<h2 style=\"color:#ff9c00;font-family:Palatino Linotype, sans-serif;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">💡 最新更新</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:1em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">岩浆怪物已被完全重构并移植至 26.1 版本！</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/W2958AD6qHc\" width=\"978\" height=\"550\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<h3 style=\"color:#ff9c00;font-family:Palatino Linotype, sans-serif;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\"><strong>26.1 更改内容</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>全新的待机、受伤和死亡音效</li>\n<li>在岩浆外行走时的音效</li>\n<li>岩浆怪物现在在成功击中目标时会发出笑声</li>\n<li>添加了新的近战咬击攻击，并配有动画</li>\n<li>完全重做了行走和游泳的动画</li>\n<li>添加了<strong>岩浆行走药水</strong>，这是从该怪物身上掉落的稀有物品</li>\n<li>添加了用桶捕捉怪物的功能，这会对怪物造成其最大生命值一半的伤害</li>\n<li>在禁用火焰轨迹时添加了新的脚步声粒子效果</li>\n<li>添加了由<strong>L200</strong>制作的新刷怪蛋纹理</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"color:#ff9c00;font-family:Palatino Linotype, sans-serif;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">🤷 常见问题解答 (FAQ)</h2>\n<h3 style=\"color:#ff9c00;font-family:Palatino Linotype, sans-serif;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">我可以在我的整合包中使用这个模组吗？</h3>\n<p style=\"font-size:1em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">当然可以。只需确保分别注明所有作者的贡献，并链接回 CurseForge 页面即可。</p>\n<h3 style=\"color:#ff9c00;font-family:Palatino Linotype, sans-serif;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">我可以将这个模组重新分发到其他平台吗？</h3>\n<p style=\"font-size:1em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">可以，只要所有下载链接都直接指向我们的 CurseForge 页面，并且给予作者适当的署名。</p>\n<h3 style=\"color:#ff9c00;font-family:Palatino Linotype, sans-serif;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">你们会移植到旧版本吗？</h3>\n<p style=\"font-size:1em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">我们专注于每年最新的“发布”版本（如 26.1, 27.1, 28.1 等），很遗憾我们没有时间进行向后移植。旧版本仍然可以游玩，但不再提供支持。源代码是开放的，您可以报告错误或审查代码，但我们不接受向后移植、贡献或第三方对我们作品的再分发。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"color:#ff9c00;font-family:Palatino Linotype, sans-serif;line-height:2.5em;font-weight:600\">🌐 翻译 Lava Monsters - 帮助打破语言障碍！</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:1em;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">所有译者都将在此获得署名。感谢每一位帮助使本模组易于访问的人！</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/southafrica.png\" alt=\"Flag for Afrikaans (Suid-Afrika)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>Afrikaans (Suid-Afrika) 翻译由：Wendigo44 完成</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/saudiarabia.png\" alt=\"Flag for اللغة العربية (alLuġah al'Arabiyye)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>اللغة العربية (alLuġah al'Arabiyye) 翻译由：VXsz, fl.bnmbnm 完成</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/spain.png\" alt=\"Flag for Català (Catalunya)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>Català (Catalunya) 翻译由：Minaderm 完成</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/czechrepublic.png\" alt=\"Flag for Čeština (Česko)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>Čeština (Česko) 翻译由：frantisekbenes65 完成</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/unitedkingdom.png\" alt=\"Flag for Cymraeg (Cymru)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>Cymraeg (Cymru) 翻译由：Fl3x_X_Placid 完成</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/germany.png\" alt=\"Flag for Deutsch\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"lin