</span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/turkey.png\" alt=\"Flag for Türkçe (Türkiye)\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>Türkçe (Türkiye) 翻译由：CreepSkeet 完成</strong> </span> <br><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/china.png\" alt=\"Flag for 简体中文（中国大陆）\" width=\"28\"> <span style=\"line-height:28px;display:inline-block\"> <strong>简体中文（中国大陆） 翻译由：S0ar1ngDeath, likefishlike 完成</strong> </span> </p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"color:#f00;font-size:2.5em\"><span style=\"display:inline;font-size:1.1em;line-height:1em\"><strong>🤚 支持：如果您对我们的模组有任何疑问或问题，请阅读常见问题解答！您也可以<a style=\"display:inline;color:#f00;font-size:1.3em;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgitlab.com%252fgroups%252fmodding-legacy%252f-%252fissues\" rel=\"nofollow\">在问题跟踪器上提交问题</a>，或者加入我们的 Discord 服务器，我们将为您提供帮助！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/thBV2Mq\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/223938153260515328/widget.png?style=banner3\" alt=\"Modding Legacy Discord Server\"></a></p>",
